    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδικός</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑδ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
